  !>             supplied.
  !>             - rocblas_fill_lower: the lower triangular part of the Hermitian matrix A is
  !>             supplied.
  !>     @param[in] n - [rocblas_int]
  !>               the order of the matrix A.
  !>     @param[in] alpha - device pointer or host pointer to scalar alpha.
